OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FPatchy cloud with sunny spells
OL,6,Fthroughout the day, with perhaps the
OL,7,Fodd light shower first thing.
OL,8,FTemperatures, around average and
OL,9,Ffeeling similar to yesterday across
OL,10,Fthe region.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FPerhaps the odd light shower
OL,13,Fat first this evening, before clearer
OL,14,Fskies develop. Feeling chilly, with
OL,15,Fmist and fog patches developing in
OL,16,Fprone locations under light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
