OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA dry and bright start for
OL,6,Fmost, with cloud increasing from the
OL,7,Feast into the afternoon but remaining
OL,8,Fdry. Around average temperatures in an
OL,9,Feasterly breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FRemaining largely dry and settled over
OL,13,Fthe next few days, with more in the
OL,14,Fway of cloud. Feeling cooler in a
OL,15,Flight to moderate easterly breeze.
